      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60e65f577ae9d0492b0f2a75|full_name} yes, I mention this as the last proposed solution which would resolve issues for both Worlds and Avatars. Would be interesting to see if someone came up of an alternative for Avatar systems like with the TrackingData Origin alternate for Worlds.\n\nI would appreciate if a change is made to fix these issues for both World and Avatars.",
